<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">LEARNING DASHBOARD</text><text class="title">你的复习节奏</text><view class="number-row"><view><text class="number">{{today}}</text><text class="label">今日复习</text></view><view><text class="number">{{total}}</text><text class="label">已记录题目</text></view><view><text class="number">{{progress}}%</text><text class="label">掌握进度</text></view></view></view><view class="section-title">掌握度分布</view><view class="distribution"><view wx:for="{{masteryItems}}" wx:key="status" class="distribution-row"><text class="dot {{item.status}}"></text><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="count">{{item.count}} 题</text></view></view><view class="tip"><text class="tip-title">学习小建议</text><text>优先复习“模糊”和“未掌握”的题目。能够不看答案讲清原理，再标记为“已掌握”。</text></view><button class="practice-button" bindtap="goPractice">继续刷题</button></view>
